---
/* faqs.html — section 2 of 3, carried across verbatim.
   See docs/PAGES.md for what it is and which hooks it carries. */
---

<section class="sec s-paper">
  <div class="wrap split w46">
    <div class="stack sticky-d">
      <p class="slug"><b>01</b><span>FAQs</span><span class="ln"></span><span class="m hide-s">14 questions</span></p>
      <h2 class="d-l" data-split>The things you’re <span class="it">probably wondering</span></h2>
      <div class="chips mt-8" data-faq-chips aria-label="Filter questions"><button type="button" data-cat="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button><button type="button" data-cat="trip" aria-pressed="false">The trip</button><button type="button" data-cat="money" aria-pressed="false">Money</button><button type="button" data-cat="who" aria-pressed="false">Who can come</button><button type="button" data-cat="ground" aria-pressed="false">On the ground</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="acc"><div class="acc-item open" data-cat-item="trip">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-0"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">So, what actually happens on an AS SCHEDULED trip?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-0"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>You travel to a city, spend the days inside one of the country’s biggest college fests and, on some plans, a couple of days in the city around it, travel, stay, food and entry are handled, the parts worth remembering are not scheduled at all</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="trip">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-1"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">What makes this different from a normal group tour?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-1"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>A tour moves you between sights, we put you in one place with people from other campuses and a fest going on around you, nobody hands you a flag to follow</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="trip">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-2"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Can I come if I don’t know anyone?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-2"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Absolutely, most of our travellers come solo, different colleges, different stories, you arrive knowing nobody and leave with people you’ll remember</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="trip">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-3"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">What if the fest changes its schedule?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-3"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>We follow the official schedule, if timings or acts move, the plan moves with them and the crew chat hears first, if a fest cancels or shifts dates you choose between the new dates, another departure or a full refund of the trip fee</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="money">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-4"><span class="n">05</span><span class="t">What’s actually included in the price?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-4"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>It depends on the departure and every trip page lists it, Hallucia includes travel from your city, stay, food, the fest pass and a trip captain, Mood Indigo includes your rooms, pickup and drop in Mumbai, meals and a trip captain, with your train or flight to Mumbai booked by you</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="money">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-5"><span class="n">06</span><span class="t">How do I pay?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-5"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Fill the booking form, scan our QR with any UPI app and pay the booking amount, then send us the screenshot on WhatsApp, the message is written for you, we confirm your seat on WhatsApp and the balance is due before departure</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="money">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-6"><span class="n">07</span><span class="t">How much is the booking amount?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-6"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>It’s 30% to confirm your seat on both trips, for Mood Indigo the other 70% is due within 30 days before the fest, for Hallucia before departure, the form shows you the exact amount before you pay</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="money">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-7"><span class="n">08</span><span class="t">Why does the Hallucia fare change by state?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-7"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Because travel from your city is in the price, the base fare is shown on the page and we confirm your exact fare on WhatsApp before you pay anything</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="money">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-8"><span class="n">09</span><span class="t">What if I need to cancel?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-8"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>More than 30 days before departure you get 80% of the trip fee back, 15 to 30 days gets 50%, under 15 days there’s no refund because your seat can’t be resold in time, the full policy is on the cancellation page</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="who">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-9"><span class="n">10</span><span class="t">Who can actually come?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-9"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>You need to be 18 or over, beyond that, all streams, all colleges, all welcome</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="who">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-10"><span class="n">11</span><span class="t">What ID do I need?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-10"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>A government photo ID and your college ID, rail tickets need the name on your ID and most fests check college ID at the gate</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="ground">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-11"><span class="n">12</span><span class="t">Who’s in charge on the trip?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-11"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>A trip captain travels with every group, start to finish, their call is final on the ground</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="ground">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-12"><span class="n">13</span><span class="t">Is it safe?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-12"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>We run verified stays, licensed transport and a written emergency protocol, wild doesn’t mean careless</p></div></div></div></div><div class="acc-item" data-cat-item="ground">
  <button class="acc-btn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-13"><span class="n">14</span><span class="t">What should I pack?</span><span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  <div class="acc-panel" id="faq-13"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Your ID, light layers, shoes you can walk a big campus in, a power bank and the one outfit you’ve been saving, pack light, you’ll come back heavy with stories</p></div></div></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
